H. FORM A — PERSIAPAN OBSERVASI
==========================================================

FORM TITLE:
FORM A — DISKUSI PERSIAPAN OBSERVASI

Filled by:
Teacher

Reviewed by:
Principal

FIELDS:

A1. Teacher identity
- Teacher name: automatic
- School: automatic
- Academic year
- Semester
- Teacher assignment

A2. Teaching information
- Grade: I–VI
- Subject
- Learning topic
- Learning objectives
