"What actions will you take to demonstrate the selected target behaviors?"

Input:
Multiline reflective response.

A6. Proposed observation schedule

Fields:
- Proposed date
- Start time
- End time
- Grade
- Subject
- Classroom location

A7. Supporting preparation

- Optional teaching plan
- Optional lesson material
- Optional PDF document

A8. Principal review

- Review note
- Approved date
- Confirmed schedule

Buttons:
